          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Kunis biyya isin dhaala gootanii ixaadhaan gosoota Israaʼeliif qoqqooduu qabdanii dha; isaan kunneenis qoodawwan isaanii taʼan\" jedha",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
